# Wanted (IDEAS I16; QUESTIONS Q29, 2; board 0.1). Fails until it is answered; then it moves up into collab/scenarios.
# Story: a chat app is in front. Its own ⌃⌥A archives the open conversation. Arbor used to bind ⌃⌥A to Arrange Windows; on a
# tester's Mac the key reached the app, twice. Whatever the cause, the habit outlives Arbor: paused, quit or crashed, the same
# fingers reach the app. So Arbor holds that key in no map, and Arrange Windows is still there for whoever asks for it.
open Chat
open Notes
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+a off
set shortcuts all
expect ok
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+a off
set shortcuts core
arrange
expect count docked 2
